<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>This macro for the game «Locked» on the Roblox platform performs sequential actions. First, he lifts the ball into the air, jumps, activates the swordscrew, kicks the ball before it drops to the floor. Normally, swordscrew activates immediately. However, the way swordscrew works is that the ball has to slam to the floor first, but by kicking it you give it a little extra bit of distance before swordscrew activates so you send the ball farther and also throw off goalkeepers. For this macro to work correctly, you will need the vevohub autoflick program. Please note that errors are possible, especially when the ping is high. It is recommended to set the sensitivity in Roblox to 171 and set the DPI to 800. The optimal screen resolution is 1920 x 1080, but others can be used, since mouse movements depend on relative coordinates. Carefully adjust the settings to achieve the best results!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
